      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.07,
          "end": 3.29,
          "en": "So to work on the styling here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.29,
          "end": 6.58,
          "en": "In the end we need to go into the GoalInput component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.58,
          "end": 8.59,
          "en": "There, we have this model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.59,
          "end": 11.2,
          "en": "and in the model we have this View.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.2,
          "end": 14.37,
          "en": "Which in the end is responsible for controlling how",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.37,
          "end": 17.173,
          "en": "the textInput and button are displayed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.39,
          "end": 20.29,
          "en": "Now I wanna change the overall look.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.29,
          "end": 22.99,
          "en": "I now wanna have the button beneath the textInput",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.942,
          "end": 25.33,
          "en": "and I wanna have another button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.33,
          "end": 27.16,
          "en": "in addition to add goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.16,
          "end": 29.47,
          "en": "Because that other button should allow us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.47,
          "end": 30.963,
          "en": "to close that model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.98,
          "end": 36.89,
          "en": "Now to achieve this I will restructure this a bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.89,
          "end": 40.63,
          "en": "And I will actually add another View in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.63,
          "end": 44.223,
          "en": "below the textInput, and move my button into this View.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.32,
          "end": 47.09,
          "en": "And add another button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.8,
          "end": 53.06,
          "en": "with a title of Cancel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.06,
          "end": 56.89,
          "en": "So that I can add the goal or cancel adding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.89,
          "end": 59.34,
          "en": "And this should in the future close my model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.34,
          "end": 61.86,
          "en": "at the moment it won't do anything though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.86,
          "end": 64.35,
          "en": "Now with that, we got that View in a View.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.35,
          "end": 67.07,
          "en": "But now I wanna change the styles of that outer View,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.07,
          "end": 69.17,
          "en": "which is the main View inside the model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.17,
          "end": 72,
          "en": "Because it's the first element in the model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72,
          "end": 74.98,
          "en": "The top most element in the model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.98,
          "end": 78.78,
          "en": "And on this input container, I wanna use flex 1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.78,
          "end": 82.53,
          "en": "So that it takes all the available space in the model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.53,
          "end": 86.963,
          "en": "But I wanna change the flexDirection back to column.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.08,
          "end": 89.87,
          "en": "And therefore we can also remove it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.87,
          "end": 91.82300000000001,
          "en": "because that is the default anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.72,
          "end": 94.69,
          "en": "With this, if I save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.69,
          "end": 97.083,
          "en": "the buttons are now below the textInput.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.93,
          "end": 100.66,
          "en": "But they are totally stretched out,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.66,
          "end": 104.03,
          "en": "because we have space between for justifyContent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.03,
          "end": 106.47,
          "en": "This should instead be center",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.47,
          "end": 109.8,
          "en": "to make sure all the content is centered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.8,
          "end": 112.12,
          "en": "This now looks way better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.12,
          "end": 113.97,
          "en": "Now in addition these two buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.97,
          "end": 116.47,
          "en": "should be next to each other",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.47,
          "end": 120.09,
          "en": "and therefore I added this View around the buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.09,
          "end": 122.96,
          "en": "and I will give this View some styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.96,
          "end": 125.29,
          "en": "So here, maybe at the bottom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.29,
          "end": 128.56,
          "en": "I'll add my buttonContainer object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.56,
          "end": 132.67,
          "en": "And actually give this a flexDirection of row.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 132.67,
          "end": 136.13,
          "en": "So that the two buttons are next to each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 136.13,
          "end": 139.93,
          "en": "And then add this buttonContainer on this View.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 139.93,
          "end": 141.86,
          "en": "So here I'll add a style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 141.86,
          "end": 143.46,
          "en": "which is styles.buttonContainer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.531,
          "end": 150.13,
          "en": "And with that, the buttons do sit next to each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.13,
          "end": 153.4,
          "en": "Now it would be nice if the buttons had",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 153.4,
          "end": 157.56,
          "en": "maybe a fixed width and some spacing between them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 157.56,
          "end": 161.23,
          "en": "And to achieve this, since I can't style these buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.23,
          "end": 162.4,
          "en": "since they're built in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.4,
          "end": 164.38,
          "en": "and since I don't wanna build my own button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 164.38,
          "end": 167.433,
          "en": "which we could do but which is some extra work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.433,
          "end": 171.38,
          "en": "I'll actually wrap each button into a View as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 171.38,
          "end": 174.47,
          "en": "Because then I can style that View instead of the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.47,
          "end": 178.92000000000002,
          "en": "And therefore still influence the look of the button a bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.92000000000002,
          "end": 183.92,
          "en": "So here I'll assign a style property to those Views here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 183.97,
          "end": 188.05,
          "en": "And setup a dedicated styling object for those buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.05,
          "end": 190.22,
          "en": "I'll name style object button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.22,
          "end": 193.4,
          "en": "And for every button here I'll just make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 193.4,
          "end": 198.4,
          "en": "that it takes, lets say, 40% of the available width.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 198.52,
          "end": 202.09,
          "en": "And then we might want to add a marginHorizontal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 202.09,
          "end": 205.34,
          "en": "So margin left and right, of eight pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 205.34,
          "end": 207.79,
          "en": "So that we have some spacing between the buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 208.76,
          "end": 211.66,
          "en": "And it's now this button style here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.66,
          "end": 215.56,
          "en": "which I wanna add to the Views that hold the buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 215.56,
          "end": 217.04,
          "en": "And that's a quick and easy way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 217.04,
          "end": 219.27,
          "en": "of setting my own styles to the buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 219.27,
          "end": 222.6,
          "en": "even though I can't change the button style itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 222.6,
          "end": 226.59,
          "en": "But you can change the width or height with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.59,
          "end": 229.27,
          "en": "you can add margins between them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 229.27,
          "end": 231.12,
          "en": "You wouldn't be able to change the color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 231.12,
          "end": 233.93,
          "en": "or text color though, if that was your plan",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.93,
          "end": 235.8,
          "en": "you would have to build your own button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 235.8,
          "end": 238.79,
          "en": "And in general, if you need more adjustments,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.79,
          "end": 240.47,
          "en": "you might wanna build your own button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 240.47,
          "end": 242.93,
          "en": "by using the pressable component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 242.93,
          "end": 244.46,
          "en": "But this is good enough for now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 244.46,
          "end": 246.71,
          "en": "and it gives me these equal sized buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.71,
          "end": 247.713,
          "en": "below the textInput.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 248.95,
          "end": 250.75,
          "en": "I also wanna have some spacing between",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 250.75,
          "end": 252.9,
          "en": "the textInputs and the buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 252.9,
          "end": 255.43,
          "en": "And maybe we can shrink them a little bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 255.43,
          "end": 258.72,
          "en": "So to shrink them I'll change the width to 30% here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 259.58,
          "end": 263.46,
          "en": "or we set this to a fixed pixel width of 100 for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 263.46,
          "end": 264.85,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 264.85,
          "end": 268.12,
          "en": "And for the spacing between the textInput and the buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 268.12,
          "end": 271.61,
          "en": "On the buttonContainer I will add a marginTop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 272.65,
          "end": 276.65999999999997,
          "en": "of let's say, 8 or maybe 16.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 276.65999999999997,
          "end": 279.09000000000003,
          "en": "So now I save this there is some distance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 279.09000000000003,
          "end": 282.503,
          "en": "between the buttons and the textInput above the buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 283.45,
          "end": 287.25,
          "en": "The textInput now also can become wider.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 287.25,
          "end": 289.787,
          "en": "So I will set the width of the textInput to 100%.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 292.766,
          "end": 295.25,
          "en": "And with that, I reloaded the app in between",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 295.25,
          "end": 298.03,
          "en": "so I will reopen this, this is now wider.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 298.03,
          "end": 301.08,
          "en": "Now it would still be nice to have some area",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 301.08,
          "end": 303.35,
          "en": "around that which is not occupied.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 303.35,
          "end": 305.3,
          "en": "And therefore on the overall container,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 305.3,
          "end": 307.56,
          "en": "Which is that root View in that model,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 307.56,
          "end": 310.43,
          "en": "I will add a little of padding in all directions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 310.43,
          "end": 313.69,
          "en": "and let's say add 16 pixels of padding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 313.69,
          "end": 316.83,
          "en": "And now I'd say this doesn't look too bad.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 316.83,
          "end": 317.75,
          "en": "Last but not least",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 317.75,
          "end": 319.86,
          "en": "we still have some extra spacing to the right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 319.86,
          "end": 321.43,
          "en": "of the textInput,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 321.43,
          "end": 323.17,
          "en": "because we had a margin to right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 323.17,
          "end": 324.97,
          "en": "and I wanna get rid of that as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 325.85,
          "end": 327.69,
          "en": "So now this does look quite good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 327.69,
          "end": 329.82,
          "en": "And of course you can adjust this a bit further",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 329.82,
          "end": 331.41,
          "en": "if you want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 331.41,
          "end": 333.88,
          "en": "Now I wanna make sure the model closes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 333.88,
          "end": 337.31,
          "en": "whenever we cancel or click add goal though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 337.31,
